# review-code

Use this skill when asked to review a pull request or a code snippet.

## Process

1. Read the diff carefully before commenting.
2. Check for logic errors, security vulnerabilities, and style violations.
3. Leave clear, actionable inline comments with suggested fixes where possible.
4. Summarise your findings at the end with an overall verdict.

{> safety-note <}
